Case 5: RestrictedRule = Array("RC-INVESTIGATION", "investigation or investigative report", "13-5.e", "13-7", "129", "e. Investigations and investigative reports; (1) Do not refer to investigations until they are concluded and do not quote directly from investigative reports;", "Needs review", "words", "", "Investigations may not be referred to until concluded, and investigative reports may not be quoted.")
